ed_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","review_id":"W7q-bizjdOV8itVm0mCf8g","date":"2015-03-11T13:29:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448155760765076,"text_excerpt":"We had a huge and delicious dinner here last night. The service was attentive and charming and they made us feel like rock stars! The steaks were cooked to perfection and so delicious. The sides were generous and equally tasty as were the sauces (we tried them all). We had the mac and cheese, au gratin potatoes, creamed spinach and mushrooms. The mushrooms were the star! The only reasons for only 4 stars ware the steak wasn't hot hot when it came out and the tomatoes in the tomato blue cheese salad were little mealy. Neither of those things would keep me from going back or giving my recommendation"},{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","review_id":"z1FeirO9r_GQTs6hD3cFKQ","date":"2014-08-23T21:02:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9416658282279968,"text_excerpt":"This place was very tasty (and pretty pricey). My husband and I both ordered steak (there isn't much on the menu other than steak...), a blue cheese salad, and tried the onion rings. Everything was delicious and the wait staff was very nice. At the end of the day, though, as a tourist in NoLa I think I'd rather eat somewhere with more local flavor (Cajun or Creole), as I can get good steak at home."},{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","review_id":"Eb3XiKkDlwzltlcuSAuppg","date":"2020-02-24T16:49:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9366825222969055,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe in all the years and all the steaks I've had in New Orleans, I've never been to Dickie Brennan's. Of course it's a classic. One of the Brennan family dynasty's. And just like most of the Brennan establishments, it didn't disappoint. We really lucked out without a reservation and ended up in a prime seat on Mardi Gras Friday. Lucked out is the key word, reservations are highly recommended. We had a phenomenal time all around. The sommelier visits your table. They have great bottles and glasses for great prices. You can go as fancy or as causal as you like. The prefix is definitely the way to go. For about $45 you get a soup or salad, an entree usually fish or steak and a ch..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","photo_id":"m-hEV7jUrgjZ5-q7mxX3Ig","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/m-hEV7jUrgjZ5-q7mxX3Ig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8830636739730835},{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","photo_id":"t7n3pzeKJcOxYiTSrsEV2w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/t7n3pzeKJcOxYiTSrsEV2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8785845637321472},{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","photo_id":"v3OQMYU5Nqgmxyp-iTfVeQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/v3OQMYU5Nqgmxyp-iTfVeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8430108428001404},{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","photo_id":"02td3ee-9I6ng19iKt1RlQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/02td3ee-9I6ng19iKt1RlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8412202596664429},{"business_id":"C26xmwM2_OgJJi2BbL3KkQ","photo_id":"I7E3RzEL0uZVfiaMSdGA4Q